SCAtools 0.5.0

This package provides a sufficiency-oriented interface to the NCA R package.
It calls NCA as an imported dependency and does not rename NCA output as new
statistical estimators. NCA 5.0.2 is authored by Jan Dul and Govert Buijs and is
distributed under the GNU General Public License version 3 or later.

The corner mapping used by SCAtools is:
  HH sufficiency -> physical corner 4
  LH sufficiency -> physical corner 3
  HL sufficiency -> physical corner 2
  LL sufficiency -> physical corner 1

